<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Shathi Reinvestment Opportunity</title>
</head>

<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; background-color: #f4f4f4;">
  <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);">
    <div style="/* background-color: #2e7d32; *//* padding: 20px; */text-align: center;">
      <img src="http://localhost:3000/assets/images/digigram-email-header.png" alt="Shathi Logo" style="max-width: 100%;height: 100px;margin-bottom: 10px;object-fit: contain;">

    </div>

    <div style="padding: 0px 25px;">
      <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px; color: #2c5530;">Dear Shathi Investor,</div>

      <div style="margin-bottom: 25px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;">
        We hope this message finds you in good health and spirit.
      </div>

      <div style="margin-bottom: 25px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;">
        We're excited to present you with an opportunity to <span style="font-weight: bold; color: #2c5530;">reinvest in your Shathi projects</span>, with improved options designed to maximize your impact and earnings. Your current investments are expected to yield returns on <span style="font-weight: bold; color: #2c5530;">
          <%= maturityDate %>
        </span>.
      </div>

      <div style="margin: 30px 0;">
        <div style="background-color: #f8f9fa; border-left: 4px solid #4a7c59; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;">
          <div style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px; color: #2c5530; margin-bottom: 8px;">Option 01 - Full Reinvestment + Additional Funds</div>
          <div style="font-style: italic; color: #666; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 10px;">(Capital + Earnings + Top-up)</div>
          <div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
            Reinvest your full earnings and principal, along with the option to top-up with more funds if desired.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="background-color: #f8f9fa; border-left: 4px solid #4a7c59; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;">
          <div style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px; color: #2c5530; margin-bottom: 8px;">Option 02 - Partial Reinvestment (Capital Only)</div>
          <div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
            Reinvest your principal amount into a new project. Returns will be calculated as per the new farm/project terms.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="background-color: #f8f9fa; border-left: 4px solid #4a7c59; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;">
          <div style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px; color: #2c5530; margin-bottom: 8px;">Option 03 - Full Settlement</div>
          <div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
            Receive your full principal + earnings on the due date directly to your bank account. <em>(No action needed)</em>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin: 25px 0; padding: 20px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8f5e8, #f0f8f0); border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
        We hope your experience with Shathi has been fulfilling. If you're ready to continue making a difference, explore new and ongoing opportunities on the Shathi app today!
      </div>

      <div style="margin: 30px 0; background-color: #f0f8f0; padding: 20px 5px; border-radius: 8px;">
        <div style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; color: #2c5530; margin-bottom: 15px;">Our Current Ongoing Projects that aligns with your investment profile:</div>
        <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0;">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th style="background-color: #2c5530; color: white; padding: 12px; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; border: 1px solid #2c5530;">Project Name</th>
              <th style="background-color: #2c5530; color: white; padding: 12px; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; border: 1px solid #2c5530;">Unit price</th>
              <th style="background-color: #2c5530; color: white; padding: 12px; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; border: 1px solid #2c5530;">Return</th>
              <th style="background-color: #2c5530; color: white; padding: 12px; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; border: 1px solid #2c5530;">Tenure</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <% for(var i=0; i<suggestedProjects.length; i++) {%>
            <tr style="background-color: white;">
              <td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd; font-size: 14px;">
                <%= suggestedProjects[i].projectName %>
                <br />
                <%= suggestedProjects[i].categoryName %>
              </td>
              <td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd; font-size: 14px;">
                BDT <%= suggestedProjects[i].unitInvestmentValue %>
              </td>
              <td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd; font-size: 14px;">
                <%= suggestedProjects[i].returnRangeMin %>% - <%= suggestedProjects[i].returnRangeMax %>%
              </td>
              <td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd; font-size: 14px;">
                <%= suggestedProjects[i].duration %> <%= suggestedProjects[i].tenure %>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <% } %>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div style="background-color: #2c5530; color: white; padding: 25px; text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;margin-bottom: 20px; border-radius: 8px;">
        <div style="font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 15px;">For any queries, please contact us:</div>
        <div style="font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
          📞 Call: <a href="tel:+8801761720230" style="color: #a8d5aa; text-decoration: none;">+880 176 172 0230</a>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
          ✉️ Email: <a href="mailto:info@digigramventures.com" style="color: #a8d5aa; text-decoration: none;">info@digigramventures.com</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="background-color: #2e7d32; padding: 25px; text-align: center;">
      <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <a href="#" style="display: inline-block; margin: 0 10px; padding: 8px 16px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 14px;">📱
          Google Play</a>
        <a href="#" style="display: inline-block; margin: 0 10px; padding: 8px 16px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 14px;">🍎
          App Store</a>
      </div>

      <p style="margin: 15px 0 0 0; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); font-size: 12px;">
        © 2025 Shathi Investment. All rights reserved.<br>
        Powered by DigiGram Ventures
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>

</html>